    "title": "ST. CLOUD NEWS - A whole weekend of Fourth fun at the Lakefront! - NewsBreak",
    "text": "1 days ago Don’t let the fun end on the 4th! Head back to Lakeshore Boulevard for the Stars & Stripes Summer Seafood Boil at the beach on Sunday, July 5 from 5-8 p.m. Presented by St. Cloud Main Street, celebrate summer, community and America’s 250th. There will be live music by Mauricio Comacho, great Crabby Bill's food and cold drinks. To pre-order your meals, call Crabby’s at the Lakefront at 407-979-4001. Read full article",
